The shared AI agent instructions for this repository live in `AGENTS.md` at the
repository root. Read and follow them.

Key rules:
- This project is hand-engineered. Help the human write the code; do not
  generate large changes unless explicitly asked.
- If you create a commit, you are **disallowed** to push to `main` without a
  Pull Request, or to cite yourself as a co-author (no `Co-Authored-By:`
  trailers or "Generated with" footers naming the AI agent).

See `AGENTS.md` and `CONTRIBUTING.md` for the full instructions.
